OL,5,Abalcony
OL,6,
OL,7,FBertulazzi already spent decades as a
OL,8,Ffugitive after he was sentenced in
OL,9,Fabsentia in Italy for the 1977
OL,10,Fkidnapping of Italian naval engineer
OL,11,FPietro Costa.
